TestResults/

# Screen captures. This repository is public and a capture of the running app can
# show real message content from live accounts or private PST archives, so images
# are ignored by default. Curate deliberately: inspect the image, then either
# `git add -f <file>` or move it under docs/assets/ to publish it.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
!docs/assets/**

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
